 Jasco V-670 spectrophotometer. The evaluation of the complexes was repeated three times and the ratio between the organic and aqueous phases was calculated. It is important to note that the selected intensity and wavelengths are in theLambert-Beer range.logP = log (CO/CW) = log(IO\\IW), c = concentration, I = intensity. The calculation was based on the intensity where I0 is the intensity of the substance in the octanol-rich phase and IW is the intensity of the substance in the water-rich phase."}]}